msgstr "Optionen für die Übermittlung über das angegebene Abholverzeichnis"

#. <label asp-for="PickupDirectoryLocation" class="ocat-label">@T["Pickup
#. directory location"]</label>
#: OrchardCore.Email.Smtp\Views\SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml:167
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "Pickup directory location"
msgstr "Speicherort des Abholverzeichnisses"

#. <span class="hint">@T[@"Use <code>/</code> for the tenant's default pickup
#. folder or a subfolder such as <code>/Outbound</code>. The configured base
#. path defaults to <code>{{ AppData }}\Sites\{{ ShellSettings.Name
#. }}\Emails</code>, is expanded from configuration only, and mail stays
#. sandboxed under that folder."]</span>
#: OrchardCore.Email.Smtp\Views\SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml:171
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Use <code>/</code> for the tenant's default pickup folder or a subfolder "
"such as <code>/Outbound</code>. The configured base path defaults to "
"<code>{{ AppData }}\\Sites\\{{ ShellSettings.Name }}\\Emails</code>, is "
"expanded from configuration only, and mail stays sandboxed under that "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie <code>/</code> für den standardmäßigen Abholordner des "
"Mandanten oder einen Unterordner wie <code>/Outbound</code>. Der "
"konfigurierte Basispfad ist standardmäßig <code>{{ AppData }}\\Sites\\{{ "
"ShellSettings.Name }}\\Emails</code>, wird ausschließlich aus der "
"Konfiguration erweitert, und E-Mails bleiben auf diesen Ordner beschränkt."

